1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We are team TERRAPULSE, from Topi, Pakistan.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
During the monsoon, clouds blind optical satellites.
NISAR's radar sees straight through.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
TerraPulse: reading Earth's signals,
revealing its changes.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A year of NISAR radar shows rice fields flooding,
growing and being harvested: twelve hundred square
kilometres of rice standing in water.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
From the Indus to the Amazon, anyone can measure,
compare and download the change.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Open source, built on NASA NISAR data.
